{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VITRIOL VR </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MARCH FOR YOUR GOD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast and Loose - Long strides and Heavy Blows churn through the wretched horde with a freedom and ease VR is yet to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand to Skull - Physics based Enemies and an in-depth elbow estimation system provide a physicality and presence to the combat which enhances gameplay beyond what was previously possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blood, Fire and Pillars of Smoke - Sinners malformed, The Righteous Risen. The Wrath of God in Iron Men. Scored by a soundtrack that hits just as hard, drowned in a haze just as thick.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2908090?t=1739418663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739418663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908090/8aa31f3bb55f1334f0dbb71b5b51ef1c49cf4a4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739418663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908090/8aa31f3bb55f1334f0dbb71b5b51ef1c49cf4a4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739418663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blow up low poly enemies and watch the 16 bit blood rain down. Mature context extends to low poly violence and occasional crude language/swearing and written descriptions of violent acts."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VITRIOL VR </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MARCH FOR YOUR GOD</p><p class